[en.FOCUS_C12_MINING_INDUSTRY_SYSTEM]
Mining Industry  System

[en.FOCUS_C12_MINING_INDUSTRY_SYSTEM_desc]
Although we have achieved many industrial accomplishments, establishing a complete industrial chain from mineral extraction to complex industrial products would bring enormous profits and liberate us from the influence of other nations. This requires regions under our control to leverage their respective advantages for collaborative industrial specialization. We will continue to progress towards this goal.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MINING_INDUSTRY_SYSTEM]
建立采矿加工体系

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MINING_INDUSTRY_SYSTEM_desc]
虽然我们已经取得了许多工业方面的成就，但是如果我们可以建立从矿物开采到复杂工业产品的一个完整的产业链，我们将从中获取巨额利润，并也且不会再被其他国家所左右，这需要我们控制的各个地区能够利用自身优势进行产业分工合作，我们将朝这个目标继续前进。


[l_english.FOCUS_C12_MINING_INDUSTRY_SYSTEM_TOOLTIP]
Every subsequent §YConstruction Expansion§! decision returns half political power

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_MINING_INDUSTRY_SYSTEM_TOOLTIP]
此后每一次进行§Y建设扩张§!决议都会在完成后返还一半的政治点！
